Output "/tmp/sshmgr-tutorial-frame.mp4"
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 640
Hide
Type "source ./.demo-env" Sleep 200ms Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "clear" Sleep 200ms Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show
Type "./sshmgr tui" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 4s
Screenshot "../11-main-servers.png"
Ctrl+C
Sleep 500ms
